{"game": "risk-of-rain-returns", "language": "english", "appid": 1337520, "month": "2024-11", "window": 3, "start_date": 1731715200, "end_date": 1732319999, "month_true_total": 81, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 00:53:17 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "179604460", "author": {"steamid": "76561199447547112", "personaname": "RazorReagan", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199447547112/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 9333, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 782, "last_played": 1779466743, "avatar": "596f2d47152c7e20909293b34bda56aa419e5448"}, "language": "english", "review": "better version of risk of rain 10 out of 10", "timestamp_created": 1732317676, "timestamp_updated": 1732317676, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179457229", "author": {"steamid": "76561197981248632", "personaname": "Goosetávoe", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/GusPlankmen/", "num_games_owned": 216, "num_reviews": 55, "playtime_forever": 13111, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 74, "playtime_at_review": 13037, "last_played": 1790866697, "avatar": "55c04f9c9a061eb53e90afd15b82ac39e09f752f"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's just the original but better, music is great as always, new content is cool, the pixel art is gorgeous.\n\nBUT.\n\nThey screwed up the difficulty scaling for some reason.\nYou can beat the game on monsoon perfectly fine, it's still hard (as it should be) but doable.\nAs soon as you loop ONCE though, everything goes to ♥♥♥♥.\nThe teleporters past stage 6 just devolve into running around like an idiot trying not to get obliterated by the 30 scavengers that spawned, said scavengers having like a billion health each, making you spend like 20 minutes SLOOOOWLY chipping away at them.\nAlso if you get an overloading worm as the boss you might as well quit to menu.\n\nI went back and played the original and it was no where near this bad, it was hard, sure, but the difficulty didn't just suddenly skyrocket as soon and you loop back to the first stage.\nIt's really weird because as long as you don't loop everything is manageable.\n\nThat aside, it's still an amazing game and I think it still does some things better than the second one, it's one of few roguelikes that just lets you get comically overpowered until you crash the game.\nIf you like being 2 hours into a run and having so much ♥♥♥♥ on the screen to the point you can't tell what's going on anymore, this is the one.", "timestamp_created": 1732139195, "timestamp_updated": 1777209059, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1699469751", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179406687", "author": {"steamid": "76561199065978850", "personaname": "polibo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199065978850/", "num_games_owned": 401, "num_reviews": 44, "playtime_forever": 5660, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4561, "last_played": 1785348493, "avatar": "820cf306dddb3121bdf83bd84ebe4d95e95c4bd4"}, "language": "english", "review": "One of my favorite games of all time. Though I may have spent less time with it than it's sequel, risk of rain returns shines so brightly in a sea of remakes and remasters. I hope it is a guiding light for the future of the games industry.", "timestamp_created": 1732074901, "timestamp_updated": 1732074901, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 15, "votes_fu